        "cooked": "<p>If something destroys this card is it considered reduced to 0 or fewer HP and everyone dies or is it just put into the discard and the game continues?</p><p>I noticed in the rules it says when something is reduced to 0 HP it is considered destroyed but nothing about the other way around.</p>",
