        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-16T04:50:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You only lose if it goes to 0 hitpoints.&nbsp; If it's destroyed through a Grappling Hook, RPG Launcher, Flash Flood, Devastating Aurora, Terraforming, Mynd-Phyre, etc. you don't lose.</p>",
